**（2）案例二：字符串综合统计**

需求：统计一段英文文本中大写字母、小写字母、空格、其他字符的个数，统计指定单词出现次数，统计单词总数。

```java
public class TextStatDemo {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        String text = "Java is a programming language. Java is object oriented.";

        int upper = 0, lower = 0, space = 0, other = 0;
        for (int i = 0; i < text.length(); i++) {
            char c = text.charAt(i);
            if (c >= 'A' && c <= 'Z') {
                upper++;
            } else if (c >= 'a' && c <= 'z') {
                lower++;
            } else if (c == ' ') {
                space++;
            } else {
                other++;
            }
        }
        System.out.println("大写=" + upper + " 小写=" + lower + " 空格=" + space + " 其他=" + other);

        System.out.println("Java 出现次数=" + countOccurrences(text, "Java"));
        System.out.println("单词数=" + text.split("\\s+").length);   // 按一个或多个空白分割
    }

    // 借助 indexOf(str, fromIndex) 连续查找子串
    public static int countOccurrences(String src, String sub) {
        int count = 0;
        int index = 0;
        while ((index = src.indexOf(sub, index)) != -1) {
            count++;
            index += sub.length();       // 跳过本次匹配，避免重复计数
        }
        return count;
    }
}
```

